{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[23,22,63,72,79,71],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"120","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008602","armor":"WP1031305","helmet":"WP1013002"},"couple":["WJ10029"]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[23,22,63,72,79,71],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"120","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008602","armor":"WP1031305","helmet":"WP1013002"},"couple":["WJ10029"]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[23,22,63,72,79,71],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"120","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008602","armor":"WP1031305","helmet":"WP1013002"},"couple":["WJ10029"]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[23,22,63,72,79,71],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008602","armor":"WP1031305","helmet":"WP1013002"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10040","city":"CS1052","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[23,22,63,72,79,71],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"120","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008602","armor":"WP1031305","helmet":"WP1013002"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1004608","name":{"zh":"孙氏完婚","en":"Lady Sun's Wedding"},"year":"219","month":"10","desc":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"biography":{"zh":"孙策长女，陆孙氏。继承了父亲的美貌，先嫁顾雍之子顾邵，顾邵去世后被其叔父孙权嫁给了陆逊。陆逊常年征战，她主持家事，维系家族稳定。在其教导下，其子陆抗亦成东吴柱石。诸葛恪被孙亮与孙峻诛杀，陆抗之妻张氏受牵连被黜。张氏之子陆景幼年由祖母陆孙氏抚养，陆孙氏去世后，陆景为其心丧三年。","tc":"孫策長女，陸孫氏。繼承了父親的美貌，先嫁顧雍之子顧邵，顧邵去世后被其叔父孫權嫁給了陸遜。陸遜常年征戰，她主持家事，維系家族穩定。在其教導下，其子陸抗亦成東吳柱石。諸葛恪被孫亮與孫峻誅殺，陸抗之妻張氏受牽連被黜。張氏之子陸景幼年由祖母陸孫氏撫養，陸孫氏去世后，陸景為其心喪三年。","en":"The eldest daughter of Sun Ce, known as Lady Sun of the Lu clan. Inheriting her father's beauty, she was first married to Gu Shao, son of Gu Yong, and after Gu Shao's death, was given in marriage to Lu Xun by her uncle Sun Quan. While Lu Xun spent years on military campaigns, she managed the household and maintained family stability. Under her guidance, her son Lu Kang also became a pillar of Eastern Wu. When Zhuge Ke was executed by Sun Liang and Sun Jun, Lu Kang's wife Lady Zhang was implicated and dismissed. Lady Zhang's son Lu Jing was raised from childhood by his grandmother, Lady Sun. After Lady Sun passed away, Lu Jing observed mourning in his heart for her for three years.","jp":"孫策の長女で、陸孫氏。父譲りの美貌を受け継ぎ、初めは顧雍の子・顧邵に嫁いだが、顧邵の死後は叔父の孫権によって陸遜へ再嫁した。陸遜が長年転戦する中、彼女が家事を切り盛りして家族の安定を維持した。その教導のもと、子の陸抗もまた東呉の柱石となった。諸葛恪が孫亮と孫峻によって誅殺されると、陸抗の妻・張氏が連座して廃された。張氏の子である陸景は幼少期に祖母の陸孫氏に養育され、陸孫氏が他界した際には、陸景は三年の心喪に服した。","kr":"손책의 장녀 육손씨. 부친의 뛰어난 용모를 물려받았다. 처음에는 고옹의 아들 고소에게 출가하였으나 고소가 세상을 떠난 후 숙부 손권에 의해 육손에게 다시 시집갔다. 육손이 오랫동안 전장을 누비는 동안 집안 살림을 도맡아 가문의 안정을 지켜 냈다. 어머니의 훌륭한 가르침 속에 아들 육항 역시 훗날 동오를 떠받치는 기둥으로 성장하였다. 제갈각이 손량과 손준에게 주살되자 육항의 처 장씨가 연루되어 폐출되었다. 장씨의 아들 육경은 어린 시절 조모 육손씨의 손에서 자랐으며, 육손씨가 세상을 떠나자 3년 동안 심상(心喪)을 치렀다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10625","remark":"","surname":"孙","surnameTc":"孫","surnameEn":"Sun","surnameJp":"孫","surnameKr":"손","surnameOther":"","name":"氏","nameTc":"氏","nameEn":"Shi","nameJp":"氏","nameKr":"씨","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"孙氏","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","